---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { EXCEL_IMPORT_LIMITS } from '../lib/excel-import-limits';
import {
  STUDENT_EXCEL_COLUMNS,
  STUDENT_EXCEL_EXAMPLE_ROWS,
  STUDENT_EXCEL_NOTES,
  STUDENT_EXCEL_SHEET,
} from '../lib/student-excel-reference';

const maxFileMb = Math.round(EXCEL_IMPORT_LIMITS.maxFileBytes / (1024 * 1024));
---

<Layout title="Registro de alumnos">
  <main class="page page-stack" data-students>
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="header-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Alumnos</p>
        <h1>Registro simple</h1>
        <p>Cargá alumnos uno a uno o subí una hoja Excel desde tu computadora para usarlos en asistencia y notas.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-block" href="/cursos">Organizar cursos</a>
    </header>

    <section class="panel student-workspace">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Registrar alumnos</h2>
        <p>Elegí cómo querés cargar el legajo. Todo arranca acá: después podés tomar asistencia y calificar.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="activity-mode-picker full-width" role="tablist" aria-label="Modo de registro">
        <label class="template-card activity-mode-card">
          <input type="radio" name="studentMode" value="manual" checked data-student-mode-input />
          <span>
            <strong>Cargar uno a uno</strong>
            <small>Completá nombre, curso, materias y contacto en el formulario.</small>
          </span>
        </label>
        <label class="template-card activity-mode-card">
          <input type="radio" name="studentMode" value="excel" data-student-mode-input />
          <span>
            <strong>Cargar desde hoja Excel</strong>
            <small>Subí un .xlsx de tu computadora con escuela, curso, turno y alumnos.</small>
          </span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="student-mode-panel full-width" data-student-mode-panel="manual">
        <form class="form-grid" data-student-form>
          <div class="input-group full-width">
            <label><span>Nombre completo</span><input name="nombre" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
            <label><span>DNI opcional</span><input name="dni" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
          </div>

          <label class="full-width">
            <span>Escuela</span>
            <select name="escuela" data-student-school required></select>
          </label>

          <label class="full-width">
            <span>Curso</span>
            <select name="cursoId" required></select>
          </label>

          <fieldset class="subject-picker">
            <legend>Materias del alumno</legend>
            <div class="subject-search" data-student-subjects></div>
            <div class="inline-form">
              <input name="nuevaMateria" data-student-new-subject placeholder="Escribí el nombre de la materia..." aria-label="Nueva materia" />
              <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" data-student-add-subject>Agregar materia</button>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <label class="full-width">
            <span>Tutor o contacto</span>
            <input name="tutor" />
          </label>

          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit">Guardar alumno</button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="student-mode-panel full-width is-hidden" data-student-mode-panel="excel">
        <div class="section-title full-width">
          <h3>Cargar hoja de alumnos</h3>
          <p>Seleccioná un Excel (.xlsx) de tu equipo. Si la escuela o el curso no existen, se crean solos al importar.</p>
        </div>

        <form
          class="form-grid full-width"
          data-student-excel-form
          data-max-file-mb={maxFileMb}
        >
          <section class="excel-reference full-width">
            <div class="section-title">
              <h4>Referencia: cómo debe verse tu Excel</h4>
              <p>
                Hoja <strong>{STUDENT_EXCEL_SHEET}</strong> · fila 1 = encabezados · datos desde la fila 2.
                Podés copiar esta estructura o descargar la plantilla lista para usar.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="table-container excel-reference-table" role="region" aria-label="Ejemplo de hoja Excel de alumnos">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    {STUDENT_EXCEL_COLUMNS.map((column) => (
                      <th>
                        {column.label}
                        {column.required
                          ? <span class="excel-ref-tag excel-ref-tag-required">obligatorio</span>
                          : <span class="excel-ref-tag">opcional</span>}
                      </th>
                    ))}
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {STUDENT_EXCEL_EXAMPLE_ROWS.map((row) => (
                    <tr>
                      {STUDENT_EXCEL_COLUMNS.map((column) => (
                        <td>{row[column.label as keyof typeof row] || '—'}</td>
                      ))}
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>

            <ul class="import-requirements excel-reference-notes">
              {STUDENT_EXCEL_NOTES.map((note) => (
                <li>{note}</li>
              ))}
              <li>Formato <strong>.xlsx</strong> · máx. {maxFileMb} MB.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <label class="full-width">
            <span>Hoja de alumnos</span>
            <input
              type="file"
              name="archivo"
              accept=".xlsx,.xls,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet,application/vnd.ms-excel"
              data-student-excel-file
              required
            />
          </label>

          <div class="ai-file-feedback full-width is-hidden" data-student-excel-feedback aria-live="polite"></div>

          <section class="excel-mapping full-width is-hidden" data-student-excel-mapping>
            <div class="section-title">
              <h4>Mapeo de columnas</h4>
              <p>Indicá qué columna de tu Excel corresponde a cada dato. Si tenés Apellido y Nombre separados, asigná ambas.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="excel-mapping-toolbar">
              <label>
                <span>Fila de encabezados</span>
                <input type="number" min="1" value="1" data-student-excel-header-row />
              </label>

              <label>
                <span>Plantilla guardada</span>
                <select data-student-excel-template-select>
                  <option value="">Sin plantilla</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>

            <div class="excel-mapping-grid" data-student-excel-mapping-fields></div>

            <div class="excel-mapping-templates">
              <input
                type="text"
                data-student-excel-template-name
                placeholder="Nombre de plantilla (ej. Planilla ministerio)"
                aria-label="Nombre de plantilla"
              />
              <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" data-student-excel-template-save>Guardar plantilla</button>
              <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-student-excel-template-delete>Eliminar</button>
            </div>

            <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" data-student-excel-apply-mapping>Actualizar vista previa</button>
          </section>

          <div class="import-result full-width" data-student-excel-preview hidden></div>
          <div class="import-result full-width" data-student-excel-result hidden></div>

          <div class="button-row full-width">
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/api/import/template?type=alumnos">Descargar plantilla</a>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" data-student-excel-submit>Cargar alumnos</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="responsive-grid">
      <section class="panel">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Alumnos cargados</h2>
          <p>Listado con curso, materias y promedio actualizado. Estos alumnos aparecen en asistencia y calificaciones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="list" data-student-list></div>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="panel export-panel" data-excel-export="alumnos">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Exportar alumnos a Excel</h2>
        <p>Descargá el listado con escuela, curso, DNI, tutor y materias. Compatible con la plantilla de carga.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="filters-grid">
        <select data-export-school aria-label="Escuela">
          <option value="">Todas las escuelas</option>
        </select>
        <select data-export-course aria-label="Curso">
          <option value="">Todos los cursos</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" data-export-submit>Exportar alumnos</button>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
